  demo/runs/          Replayed runs. Contain KEGG pathway records, STRING interaction
                      records, PubMed titles and abstracts, WHO-graded resistance
                      variants (via TB-Profiler/tbdb) and lineage-barcode markers.
  tests/fixtures/     Recorded API responses from KEGG, STRING, UniProt and PubMed,
                      and a small PubMed abstract corpus (corpus_small.json).

